# A banker's lamp: green glass shade on a brass stem, with a pull chain. Sits
# on the reading table; the origin drops its foot onto the table top. The
# bottom band of the glass glows.
sprite library-bankers-lamp
size 16 20
layer object
footprint 1 1
origin 0 22
walkable
zbias 1
tag lamp light library
light 8 8 36 #ffd27a 1.0

frame default
